The images in this folder are from paperlesspaper's sample-images repository
(https://github.com/paperlesspaper/sample-images, commit 72e1dc0). Its README says the example
photos were taken by utzel-butzel (https://github.com/Utzel-Butzel), that you are free to use the
images for your projects, and that they are not intended for commercial use yet (ask first).
The Apache License 2.0 of this repository does not cover them.

portrait.jpg is AI-generated (from the repository's "AI generated" folder), not a photograph. It is
here because none of the real photos shows skin in colour.

Each was cover-cropped to 4:3 and resized to the panel size in linear light (Lanczos), with
spectra6_dither.prep.resize_cover, and saved without metadata (JPEG quality 92, 4:4:4; the grey
ramp as PNG).

